  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-tools-tool\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 2. tool hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\">Tools</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">QR Code Generator</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"QR Code Generator\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/qr-generator/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">&gt;_ tools --qr-generate</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">QR Code Generator</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMake a QR code for any link, text, email, phone, WiFi network, or SMS - right in your browser. Pick the colors, size, and error level, then export as PNG or SVG. Nothing is uploaded.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (QR generator) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"qr-app\">\n<div class=\"qr-wrap\">\n<div class=\"qr-msg\" id=\"qr-msg\" hidden></div>\n<div class=\"qr-layout\">\n<!-- settings first (King order: settings before the QR code) -->\n<section class=\"qr-card\">\n<div class=\"qr-sec\"><span class=\"qr-sdot\"></span><h2>SETTINGS</h2><span class=\"qr-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"qr-ctrl\">\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<label class=\"qr-lbl\" for=\"qr-typeTxt\">Content type</label>\n<select class=\"qr-in qr-select\" id=\"qr-typeTxt\">\n<option value=\"0\">URL</option>\n<option value=\"1\">Text</option>\n<option value=\"2\">Email</option>\n<option value=\"3\">Phone</option>\n<option value=\"4\">WiFi</option>\n<option value=\"5\">SMS</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<!-- URL -->\n<div class=\"qr-group\" id=\"qr-urlGroup\">\n<label class=\"qr-lbl\" for=\"qr-url\">Link / URL</label>\n<input class=\"qr-in\" type=\"url\" id=\"qr-url\" inputmode=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://example.com\" value=\"\">>\n</div>\n<!-- Text -->\n<div class=\"qr-group\" id=\"qr-textGroup\" hidden>\n<label class=\"qr-lbl\" for=\"qr-text\">Text</label>\n<textarea class=\"qr-in qr-ta\" id=\"qr-text\" placeholder=\"Type anything…\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<!-- Email / Phone / WiFi / SMS - one value field, placeholder changes; fields separated by | -->\n<div class=\"qr-group\" id=\"qr-otherGroup\" hidden>\n<label class=\"qr-lbl\" for=\"qr-other\">Details</label>\n<input class=\"qr-in\" type=\"text\" id=\"qr-other\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n<p class=\"qr-other-hint\" id=\"qr-otherHint\" hidden></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<span class=\"qr-lbl\">Size</span>\n<div class=\"qr-row\">\n<input class=\"qr-range\" type=\"range\" id=\"qr-size\" min=\"160\" max=\"640\" step=\"8\" value=\"320\">\n<span class=\"qr-val\" id=\"qr-sizeVal\">320px</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<span class=\"qr-lbl\">Quiet zone (margin)</span>\n<div class=\"qr-row\">\n<input class=\"qr-range\" type=\"range\" id=\"qr-margin\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n<span class=\"qr-val\" id=\"qr-marginVal\">2</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<label class=\"qr-lbl\" for=\"qr-ec\">Error correction</label>\n<select class=\"qr-in qr-select\" id=\"qr-ec\">\n<option value=\"L\">L - 7% (smaller)</option>\n<option value=\"M\" selected>M - 15% (default)</option>\n<option value=\"Q\">Q - 25%</option>\n<option value=\"H\">H - 30% (most robust)</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<span class=\"qr-lbl\">Colors</span>\n<div class=\"qr-swatches\">\n<label class=\"qr-swatch\"><input type=\"color\" id=\"qr-fg\" value=\"#00ff91\">code</label>\n<label class=\"qr-swatch\"><input type=\"color\" id=\"qr-bg\" value=\"#0a0a0a\">background</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-group\">\n<span class=\"qr-lbl\">Logo (optional)</span>\n<div class=\"qr-logo-row\">\n<label class=\"qr-btn qr-btn--ghost qr-btn--sm\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">Choose logo<input type=\"file\" id=\"qr-logo\" accept=\"image/*\" hidden></label>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"qr-btn qr-btn--ghost qr-btn--sm\" id=\"qr-logoClear\">Clear</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- live preview - below the settings (King order) -->\n<section class=\"qr-card\">\n<div class=\"qr-sec\"><span class=\"qr-sdot\"></span><h2>PREVIEW &amp; EXPORT</h2><span class=\"qr-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"qr-stage\">\n<canvas id=\"qr-canvas\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\" aria-label=\"Live QR code preview\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qr-actions\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"qr-btn qr-btn--primary\" id=\"qr-dlPng\">Download PNG</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"qr-btn qr-btn--outline\" id=\"qr-dlSvg\">Download SVG</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"qr-btn qr-btn--ghost\" id=\"qr-copy\">Copy data</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"qr-foot\">no server · no uploads · generated entirely on your device</footer>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 4. related tools ═══ -->\n<section class=\"qr-related\" aria-labelledby=\"qr-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"qr-related-h\" class=\"qr-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"qr-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"qr-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/image-compressor/\">\n<span class=\"qr-rel-name\">Image Compressor &amp; WebP Converter</span>\n<span class=\"qr-rel-desc\">Shrink the assets your QR points to.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"qr-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/password-generator/\">\n<span class=\"qr-rel-name\">Password Generator</span>\n<span class=\"qr-rel-desc\">Strong WiFi passwords - then QR-share them.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"qr-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/json-formatter/\">\n<span class=\"qr-rel-name\">JSON Formatter</span>\n<span class=\"qr-rel-desc\">Paste-and-go validation - same privacy promise.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"qr-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/schema-generator/\">\n<span class=\"qr-rel-name\">Schema / JSON-LD Generator</span>\n<span class=\"qr-rel-desc\">Structure your pages for search engines.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ 5. FAQ (visible - mirrors the FAQPage schema) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"qr-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"qr-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"qr-faq-h\" class=\"qr-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"qr-faq-item\">\n<summary>How do I make a QR code for a WiFi network?</summary>\n<p>Choose &quot;WiFi&quot; as the content type, then enter the network name (SSID), password, and security type (WPA/WEP/nopass) separated by | - for example: MyNetwork|mypass123|WPA. The tool builds the WIFI: string the scanner expects.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"qr-faq-item\">\n<summary>Is the QR code generator private?</summary>\n<p>Yes. The QR code is generated entirely in your browser with the Canvas API - nothing you type ever leaves your device, and no account is needed.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"qr-faq-item\">\n<summary>Can I customize the QR code colors?</summary>\n<p>Yes. Pick any foreground and background color, adjust the size and quiet-zone margin, choose an error-correction level, and even drop a logo in the middle - the preview updates live as you type.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"qr-faq-item\">\n<summary>What formats can I export?</summary>\n<p>PNG (raster, any size up to 640px) and SVG (vector, scales infinitely). Both are generated on your device the moment you press download.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\